#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:1 65a56a2fe3ab4687828d38fb74256277
msgid "分体控制 vs 全身控制"
msgstr "分体控制 vs 全身控制"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:3 51fa90c2ca404ffcbd3073acc247708f
msgid ""
"Two real launch paths in [ocs2_arm_controller](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/launch), "
"also offered as **split body** / **full body** in the [open-deploy-ws "
"`arx-lift2s` README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob"
"/arx-lift2s/README.EN.md)."
msgstr ""
"[ocs2_arm_controller](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/launch) "
"中有两条真实 launch 路径，在 [open-deploy-ws `arx-lift2s` "
"README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/arx-"
"lift2s/README.EN.md) 中也对应 **分体** / **全身**。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 840c33ef1fea4490bb9ecadcfd2a808a
msgid "**分体控制** (split)"
msgstr "**分体控制**（split）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 3cec2a142a7746648b9b18e2f18d909d
msgid "**全身控制** (whole-body)"
msgstr "**全身控制**（whole-body）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 7600a3ec113146f688bbbe8df883cd88
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 6114767a5bf44fe7a9427b9bb605926d
msgid "Arms and body/head (and typically hands) run as **separate** controllers"
msgstr "手臂与身体/头（通常还有手）由**各自独立**的控制器运行"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 0a15f989e30b4bbfaf193d46856eaa08
msgid "One **unified** whole-body MPC controller"
msgstr "一个**统一**的全身 MPC 控制器"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 50093837c35e4924b03d4d53dfbfeb1d
msgid "Arm / body"
msgstr "手臂 / 身体"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 1b1c05f55a694c949ea55e8e119b3c49
msgid ""
"[ocs2_arm_controller](../4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md)"
" + "
"[basic_joint_controller](../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)"
" (`setup_body_controllers` for `body` and `head`)"
msgstr ""
"[ocs2_arm_controller](../4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md)"
" + "
"[basic_joint_controller](../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)（`setup_body_controllers`"
" 用于 `body` 和 `head`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 8c17062960d44d5787cb7df810e0d81f
msgid ""
"[ocs2_wbc_controller](../4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md) using "
"`ocs2_wheel_humanoid`"
msgstr ""
"[ocs2_wbc_controller](../4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md)，使用 "
"`ocs2_wheel_humanoid`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md f2566855006e4b0f98d0aa6617aaeb13
msgid "Launch"
msgstr "启动"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 8cf7f4c1a6234ca3949fa94bce7a8d25
msgid ""
"`ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py` (`launch_mode` "
"`split_body`)"
msgstr ""
"`ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py`（`launch_mode` "
"`split_body`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md ac95847c17ac4a669376eba7c6b18b73
msgid ""
"`ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py` (`launch_mode` "
"`full_body`) when the robot config type is "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller/Ocs2WbcController`"
msgstr ""
"当机器人配置 type 为 `ocs2_wbc_controller/Ocs2WbcController` 时：`ros2 launch "
"ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py`（`launch_mode` `full_body`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md a76f1b482f6e413292e24490ce0fc5b7
msgid "Lift2S menu"
msgstr "Lift2S 菜单"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 1645b6ae008a4e1986c40a2757c1c562
msgid "`./quick_start.sh` → Launch → Lift2S → **split body**"
msgstr "`./quick_start.sh` → Launch → Lift2S → **分体**（菜单：`split body`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md bd3867889d4944e49ef5983446ab185b
msgid "same menu → **full body**"
msgstr "同一菜单 → **全身**（菜单：`full body`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:12
#: 1322982b861f488ea12b6753223bfeac
msgid ""
"`split_body.launch.py` is the split (分体) path. Whole-body control uses "
"`full_body.launch.py` (there is no public standalone `ros2 launch "
"ocs2_wbc_controller …` entry)."
msgstr ""
"`split_body.launch.py` 是分体路径。全身控制用 `full_body.launch.py`（没有公开的单独 `ros2 "
"launch ocs2_wbc_controller …` 入口）。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:14
#: a7be830ee49a4fa1a8ce6e87746b1ff0
msgid "Packages"
msgstr "软件包"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:16
#: cbe5f9036c3e41e5aa446761b0fa1fef
msgid ""
"**basic_joint_controller** — joint FSM Home / Hold / MoveJ; "
"`/fsm_command` is `std_msgs/Int32`. How-to: [Use "
"basic_joint_controller](../2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md)."
msgstr ""
"**basic_joint_controller** — 关节 FSM Home / Hold / MoveJ；`/fsm_command` 是 "
"`std_msgs/Int32`。操作指南：[使用 "
"basic_joint_controller](../2-how_to/4-controllers/11-basic_joint.md)。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:17
#: c0265012d8e54c70aaf7aec990d88c8b
msgid "**ocs2_arm_controller** — arm MPC FSM HOME / OCS2 / HOLD (package README)."
msgstr "**ocs2_arm_controller** — 手臂 MPC FSM HOME / OCS2 / HOLD（软件包 README）。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:18
#: f74f498d29ec4db8a1b2bd18e0b855ad
msgid ""
"**ocs2_wbc_controller** — private submodule; whole-body MPC. States and "
"topics are in that package README after access."
msgstr "**ocs2_wbc_controller** — 私有子模块；全身 MPC。状态和话题在开通后的包 README 里。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:20
#: 0e6b357660314f80b07ac1b4f6321179
#, #
msgid ""
"FSM command values, Action / Service tables, and WBC Cartesian topics: "
"[FSM and Topics](4-fsm_and_topics.md). Controllers index: [Controllers "
"reference](../4-reference/controllers/0-index.md)."
msgstr ""
"FSM 命令取值、Action / Service 表以及 WBC 笛卡尔话题：[FSM "
"与话题](4-fsm_and_topics.md)。控制器索引：[控制器参考](../4-reference/controllers/0-index.md)。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:22
#: 654ad6e3a90849a5a865d905f081643a
msgid ""
"`/body_target*`, `/head_target*`, `/mode_command`, and `WbcCurrentState` "
"need **`ocs2_wbc_controller`** and that robot’s 全身 launch/config. Default"
" mock demos (`demo.launch.py`) and 分体 do **not** imply those features are"
" present; capability bits are machine-dependent. Public Taku mock uses "
"`split_body.launch.py robot:=taku`; `full_body.launch.py robot:=taku` "
"still needs the private `ocs2_wbc_controller` submodule (shipping "
"`config/ocs2/fixed_base_tcp.info` is not enough)."
msgstr ""
"`/body_target*`、`/head_target*`、`/mode_command` 以及 `WbcCurrentState` 需要 "
"**`ocs2_wbc_controller`** 以及该机型的全身启动/配置。默认 mock "
"演示（`demo.launch.py`）和分体**并不表示**这些能力可用；能力位取决于机型。公开的 Taku mock 使用 "
"`split_body.launch.py robot:=taku`；`full_body.launch.py robot:=taku` "
"仍需要私有 `ocs2_wbc_controller` 子模块（描述里有 `config/ocs2/fixed_base_tcp.info` "
"并不够）。"

#~ msgid "Packages (do not invent)"
#~ msgstr "软件包（不要编造）"

